From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Franck Nijhof <opensource@frenck.dev>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 16:26:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Patch /data to /config folder

The add-on stores its user-visible state in /config (the addon_config
share) instead of the upstream /data location.

The JWT key pair in backend/lib/config.js is deliberately left on
/data/keys.json. That path is per-add-on persistent storage, and moving
it would regenerate the key pair on existing installs, logging every
user out.
